        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rose Byrne, Nicholas Stoller, Jonah Hill, Russell Brand, Judd Apatow\n- Films: Troy, 28 Weeks Later, Knowing, Insidious, Get Him to the Greek, Bridesmaids, Neighbors, Spy, Forgetting Sarah Marshall\n- Roles: actress, director, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Mary Rose Byrne was born on 24 July 1979 and is an Australian actress.\n- Rose Byrne starred in the films Troy, 28 Weeks Later, Knowing, and Insidious.\n- Get Him to the Greek was released on June 4, 2010.\n- Get Him to the Greek is a spin-off sequel to Nicholas Stoller’s 2008 film Forgetting Sarah Marshall.\n- Get Him to the Greek reunited director Nicholas Stoller with stars Jonah Hill and Russell Brand and producer Judd Apatow.\n- Rose Byrne also starred in the comedies Get Him to the Greek, Bridesmaids, Neighbors, and Spy.",
